From: Gryphfield
Subject: [PATCH] util: include <iomanip> for std::setw and std::setfill.

com_guid.cpp relied on <iomanip> arriving through another header. With the libstdc++ of
current mingw-w64 (Homebrew) it no longer does, so DXMT v0.80 fails to compile. Build fix
only; no behaviour change.
---
diff --git a/src/util/com/com_guid.cpp b/src/util/com/com_guid.cpp
index 11bf4a7..05bda6c 100644
--- a/src/util/com/com_guid.cpp
+++ b/src/util/com/com_guid.cpp
@@ -8,6 +8,7 @@
  * See <https://github.com/doitsujin/dxvk/blob/master/LICENSE>
  */
 
+#include <iomanip>
 #include <mutex>
 #include <unordered_set>
 
